end
put A 1 n
put A 2 2
ret true
end
if eq status 3
put A 1 0
put A 2 3
ret true
end
end
put A 2 4
ret true
end
note Reply parsing can serialize AGAIN internally. Preserve the already offered
note datagram until the provider records its send result, including on refusal.
fn appreceive now ulong to bool
if not appclock now
ret false
